  "description": "K.S. Badwal and Bimla Badwal, a married couple who speak the Marcha dialect of Rongpo, talk about their wedding many decades ago. Subhashish Panigrahi interviewed them in 2019 for his 2021 documentary MarginalizedAadhaar. Panigrahi edited unused or trimmed footage from the film and published it under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2025. Hindi subtitles are by Kimmi Pal, a Rongpo speaker and OpenSpeaks Fellow, with advice from Bhawani Pal and edits by Panigrahi, and the English translation is by Panigrahi.",
